    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Read Before Purchasing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;NAGARA&quot; style Desktop is currently officially supported on Windows 10 and Windows 11.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb&quot;NAGARA&quot; style Desktop is currently under development. We plan to release new features and updates regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt mirrors your PC desktop into a VR environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt uses an overlay system, allowing you to use it with other VR applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can freely position, resize, and rotate your desktop windows and applications within the VR space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFeatures a handy one-click function to separate all windows on your monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCompatible with Input 2.0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSupports left-click, right-click, long-press, and drag-and-drop actions. Mouse wheel is supported via joystick controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSupports both Japanese and English languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCompatible with both Japanese 109A and English 104 keyboards, with the option to customize the numeric keypad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIncludes a feature to customize the height of your viewpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any problems or have questions, please report them to us via our social media account.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Read Before Purchasing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;NAGARA&quot; style Desktop is currently officially supported on Windows 10 and Windows 11.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb&quot;NAGARA&quot; style Desktop is currently under development. We plan to release new features and updates regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt mirrors your PC desktop into a VR environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt uses an overlay system, allowing you to use it with other VR applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can freely position, resize, and rotate your desktop windows and applications within the VR space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFeatures a handy one-click function to separate all windows on your monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCompatible with Input 2.0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSupports left-click, right-click, long-press, and drag-and-drop actions. Mouse wheel is supported via joystick controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSupports both Japanese and English languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCompatible with both Japanese 109A and English 104 keyboards, with the option to customize the numeric keypad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIncludes a feature to customize the height of your viewpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any problems or have questions, please report them to us via our social media account.</p>",
